    {
      "name": "Enrichment",
      "description": "Endpoints de enriquecimento de leads B2B com dados do OpenAlex.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "GET /sample",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/sample",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["sample"]
            },
            "description": "Retorna um payload de exemplo com metadados do serviço. Útil para verificar a estrutura de resposta e confirmar que a integração está correta.\n\nO campo `transport` sempre será `\"http\"` neste endpoint."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Payload de exemplo",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "GET",
                "header": [],
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/sample",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["sample"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"component\": \"lf-openalex-enrichment-mvp\",\n  \"source\": \"openalex\",\n  \"status\": \"ok\",\n  \"generatedAt\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\",\n  \"transport\": \"http\",\n  \"generatedAtHttp\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "POST /enrich",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"leads\": [\n    {\n      \"company\": \"Acme Corp\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"industry\": \"Tecnologia\",\n      \"employee_count\": 200\n    },\n    {\n      \"company\": \"Beta Inc\",\n      \"domain\": \"\",\n      \"industry\": \"Finanças\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"config\": {\n    \"fields\": [\"company\", \"domain\", \"industry\", \"employee_count\"]\n  }\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/enrich",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["enrich"]
            },
            "description": "Processa um lote de leads B2B e retorna dados enriquecidos com métricas de cobertura de atributos.\n\nPara cada lead é calculado o campo `_enrichment.coverage` (0 a 1), indicando a proporção de campos obrigatórios preenchidos.\n\n**Um lead é considerado enriquecido quando `coverage > 0.5`.**\n\n**Campos avaliados por padrão:** `company`, `domain`, `industry`, `employee_count`.\n\nO parâmetro `config.fields` permite customizar os campos avaliados.\n\n**Campos da resposta:**\n- `enriched`: lista de leads com `_enrichment` adicionado\n- `stats.total`: total de leads processados\n- `stats.enriched_count`: leads com coverage > 0.5\n- `stats.coverage_rate`: média de cobertura de todos os leads\n- `stats.enrichment_rate`: proporção de leads enriquecidos"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Leads enriquecidos",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"leads\": [\n    {\n      \"company\": \"Acme Corp\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"industry\": \"Tecnologia\",\n      \"employee_count\": 200\n    },\n    {\n      \"company\": \"Beta Inc\",\n      \"domain\": \"\",\n      \"industry\": \"Finanças\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"config\": null\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/enrich",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["enrich"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"enriched\": [\n    {\n      \"company\": \"Acme Corp\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"industry\": \"Tecnologia\",\n      \"employee_count\": 200,\n      \"_enrichment\": {\n        \"coverage\": 1.0,\n        \"processed_at\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\",\n        \"source\": \"openalex\"\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"company\": \"Beta Inc\",\n      \"domain\": \"\",\n      \"industry\": \"Finanças\",\n      \"employee_count\": \"\",\n      \"_enrichment\": {\n        \"coverage\": 0.5,\n        \"processed_at\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\",\n        \"source\": \"openalex\"\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"stats\": {\n    \"total\": 2,\n    \"enriched_count\": 1,\n    \"coverage_rate\": 0.75,\n    \"enrichment_rate\": 0.5\n  },\n  \"processed_at\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Value Score",
      "description": "Endpoints de classificação de contas por score e banda de valor.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/value-score",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"accountId\": \"acme-001\",\n  \"score\": 80\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/value-score",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "value-score"]
            },
            "description": "Recebe o `accountId` e um `score` numérico (0–100) e retorna a classificação em banda de valor.\n\n**Lógica de bandas:**\n- `score >= 80` → `high`\n- `score >= 50` → `medium`  \n- `score < 50` → `low`\n\nO score é normalizado (clamped) para o intervalo [0, 100]. Valores negativos viram 0 e valores acima de 100 viram 100.\n\n**Campos obrigatórios:** `accountId`, `score`"
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Band high",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"accountId\": \"acme-001\",\n  \"score\": 80\n}"
                },
