    {
      "name": "Lead Prioritization",
      "description": "Endpoints de priorização de leads por gap de enriquecimento.",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "POST /v1/leads/prioritize",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              {
                "key": "Content-Type",
                "value": "application/json"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"leads\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l1\",\n      \"company\": \"Acme\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"coverage\": 0.4\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l2\",\n      \"company\": \"Beta\",\n      \"coverage\": 0.8\n    }\n  ],\n  \"weights\": null\n}",
              "options": {
                "raw": {
                  "language": "json"
                }
              }
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/leads/prioritize",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["v1", "leads", "prioritize"]
            },
            "description": "Ordena uma lista de leads por prioridade de enriquecimento. Leads com mais campos faltantes recebem score maior e aparecem no topo da lista.\n\n**Pesos padrão por campo:**\n- `company`: 3\n- `domain`: 2\n- `email`: 2\n- `industry`: 1\n- `employee_count`: 1\n\nO campo `_priorityScore` é adicionado a cada lead na resposta. Em caso de empate no score, a ordem original de entrada é preservada.\n\nPasse `weights: null` para usar os pesos padrão, ou forneça um objeto com pesos customizados.\n\n**Caso de uso:** Use este endpoint antes de iniciar campanhas de enriquecimento para identificar quais leads têm maior lacuna de dados e devem ser processados primeiro."
          },
          "response": [
            {
              "name": "200 - Leads priorizados",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"leads\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l1\",\n      \"company\": \"Acme\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"coverage\": 0.4\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l2\",\n      \"company\": \"Beta\",\n      \"coverage\": 0.8\n    }\n  ],\n  \"weights\": null\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/leads/prioritize",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "leads", "prioritize"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"prioritized\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l2\",\n      \"company\": \"Beta\",\n      \"coverage\": 0.8,\n      \"_priorityScore\": 4\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l1\",\n      \"company\": \"Acme\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"coverage\": 0.4,\n      \"_priorityScore\": 2\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 2,\n  \"processed_at\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\"\n}"
            },
            {
              "name": "200 - Com pesos customizados",
              "originalRequest": {
                "method": "POST",
                "header": [
                  {
                    "key": "Content-Type",
                    "value": "application/json"
                  }
                ],
                "body": {
                  "mode": "raw",
                  "raw": "{\n  \"leads\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l1\",\n      \"company\": \"Acme\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l2\",\n      \"company\": \"Beta\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"weights\": {\n    \"company\": 5,\n    \"domain\": 3,\n    \"email\": 4\n  }\n}"
                },
                "url": {
                  "raw": "{{base_url}}/v1/leads/prioritize",
                  "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
                  "path": ["v1", "leads", "prioritize"]
                }
              },
              "status": "OK",
              "code": 200,
              "header": [
                {
                  "key": "Content-Type",
                  "value": "application/json; charset=utf-8"
                }
              ],
              "body": "{\n  \"prioritized\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l2\",\n      \"company\": \"Beta\",\n      \"_priorityScore\": 7\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"l1\",\n      \"company\": \"Acme\",\n      \"domain\": \"acme.com\",\n      \"_priorityScore\": 4\n    }\n  ],\n  \"total\": 2,\n  \"processed_at\": \"2026-04-18T10:00:00+00:00\"\n}"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
